# Vulnerabilities and misconfigurations Trivy must not report for the
# app image (.github/workflows/image.yml). Every entry carries its
# reason and the decision that backs it; an entry without one is a bug.
#
# DS-0002 "Image user should not be 'root'": the app stage is
# FROM scratch (D161) with no USER on purpose. The Home Assistant
# Supervisor starts app containers as root and owns /data as root; a
# non-root USER could not write the SQLite database or photos there.
# There is no shell or package manager in the image to abuse either.
DS-0002
